# Copy to .env (Git-ignored) and fill in one provider. The server reads it on start; the browser never sees it.
# AI_PROVIDER: anthropic | openai | school | none   (none = rule ranking only)
AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides
# AI_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# AI_EFFORT=low
# AI_TIMEOUT_MS=10000   (명세 2-4: 10초를 넘기면 규칙 정렬로 채움)

# ChatGPT
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=

# School-provided AI (assumes an OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint; confirm with the school)
# SCHOOL_AI_BASE_URL=
# SCHOOL_AI_API_KEY=
# SCHOOL_AI_MODEL=

# Korea Tourism Organization TourAPI (data.go.kr "한국관광공사_국문 관광정보 서비스_GW"). Used by
# `node scripts/tourapi-places.mjs` to compare place coordinates and, since D44, by the server for places, photos and
# events around the chosen point (위치기반 관광정보·행사정보). Use the general key marked "Decoding".
# TOURAPI_KEY=

# Kakao map for the living map (stage 6). Unlike the keys above, this JavaScript key is sent to the browser; it
# works only on the site domains registered for it at developers.kakao.com (앱 > 카카오맵 사용 설정 ON,
# 플랫폼 키 > JavaScript 키 > JavaScript SDK 도메인, e.g. http://localhost:4173 and the --lan https address).
# Without it the map screen shows the same places as a list.
# KAKAO_JS_KEY=

# Seoul weather for the season backdrop (D35): data.go.kr "기상청_단기예보 조회서비스" (활용신청, 자동승인). The
# data.go.kr general key ("Decoding") is the same for every service on one account, so TOURAPI_KEY is used when this
# is empty. Only the summary (맑음·비·눈 …) reaches the browser. Without it the app shows the season only.
# KMA_SERVICE_KEY=

# Typed departures (D39): the same Kakao app's "REST API 키" (developers.kakao.com > 앱 > 앱 키). Used only by the
# server for Kakao Local address/keyword search; no domain registration needed. Without it the app searches its
# own stations and candidate places only. Since D44 the same key finds places around the chosen point (카테고리·
# 키워드 검색) and names its 행정동; without it (and without TOURAPI_KEY) the picks come from data/places.json.
# KAKAO_REST_KEY=

# Seoul real-time city data (D44, Q16): 서울 열린데이터광장 (data.seoul.go.kr) > 인증키 신청 > 일반 인증키, for
# "서울시 실시간 도시데이터" (citydata, 주요 장소 혼잡도). Paste the key with nothing around it (no quotes or spaces).
# The server shows live crowding for picks near the 119 places in data/seoul_hotspots.json (P61); it also needs
# KAKAO_REST_KEY to find where those places are. `node scripts/seoul-hotspots.mjs` refreshes that list.
# SEOUL_DATA_KEY=

# D53/P77: 한국관광공사 영문 관광정보 서비스(EngService2). Used for English place names in languages other than Korean;
# empty → no English names are added.
# TOURAPI_EN_KEY=
